* Opening preempts

Booklet section "OPENING PREEMPTS": a 3- or 4-level opening tends toward sound at
equal or unfavorable vulnerability (within two or three tricks of the bid) and
lighter at favorable vulnerability (within four tricks). The booklet gives no
numeric HCP/length table, so the ranges below (7 cards for a 3-level preempt, 8+
for a 4-level preempt, all in the 5--10/11 HCP band) are an interpolation from the
"rule of 2/3/4" and standard practice; see NOTES.md #5. Vulnerability itself is not
part of the description vocabulary, so the trick-count discipline is left to the
sampler/user rather than encoded here.

3C = {prio:51} 7=!c, 5--9 hcp
3D = {prio:52} 7=!d, 5--9 hcp
3H = {prio:53} 7=!h, 5--9 hcp
3S = {prio:54} 7=!s, 5--9 hcp
4C = {prio:55} 8+!c, 5--10 hcp
4D = {prio:56} 8+!d, 5--10 hcp
4H = {prio:57} 8+!h, 5--10 hcp
4S = {prio:58} 8+!s, 5--10 hcp

** Responses to a 3-level preempt

A raise is to play (further preemption over a minor, game over a major); a new
suit is forcing (13+ hcp and a five-card suit); 3NT is to play (14+ hcp); 4NT
is Blackwood (18+ hcp with support). Every response has a real range, so a
hand that fits none of them passes (NOTES.md "Notrump lane" #N6). After a new
suit, opener raises with three-card support and otherwise rebids his own suit;
a sign-off is followed by an explicit pass.

3C-
4N = !BW, 18+ hcp, 2+!c
3D = F, 13+ hcp, 5+!d
  4D = 3+!d
  4C = unlimited
3H = F, 13+ hcp, 5+!h
  4H = 3+!h
    #STOP
  4C = unlimited
3S = F, 13+ hcp, 5+!s
  4S = 3+!s
    #STOP
  4C = unlimited
3N = 14+ hcp
  P = unlimited
    #STOP
4C = 3+!c, 6--13 hcp
  P = unlimited
    #STOP

3D-
4N = !BW, 18+ hcp, 2+!d
3H = F, 13+ hcp, 5+!h
  4H = 3+!h
    #STOP
  4D = unlimited
3S = F, 13+ hcp, 5+!s
  4S = 3+!s
    #STOP
  4D = unlimited
3N = 14+ hcp
  P = unlimited
    #STOP
4D = 3+!d, 6--13 hcp
  P = unlimited
    #STOP

3H-
4N = !BW, 18+ hcp, 2+!h
4H = 2+!h, 12--17 hcp
  P = unlimited
    #STOP
3S = F, 13+ hcp, 5+!s
  4S = 3+!s
    #STOP
  4H = unlimited
    #STOP
3N = 14+ hcp
  P = unlimited
    #STOP

3S-
