4S = 2+!s, 12--17 hcp
  P = unlimited
    #STOP
3N = 14+ hcp
  P = unlimited
    #STOP

** Responses to a 4-level preempt

At the 4-level the only realistic continuations are to pass, raise a minor to
game, or ask for aces with a slam-going hand; each has a real range.

4C-
4N = !BW, 18+ hcp
5C = 2+!c, 13--17 hcp
  P = unlimited
    #STOP

4D-
4N = !BW, 18+ hcp
5D = 2+!d, 13--17 hcp
  P = unlimited
    #STOP

4H-
4N = !BW, 18+ hcp

4S-
4N = !BW, 18+ hcp

** Interference over a preempt

After any overcall of a preempt, responder doubles for penalty with 13+ hcp
and otherwise passes (NOTES.md "Notrump lane" #N6); the partnership then passes
from there on, and also after the opponents double the preempt (NOTES.md #P7).

3C-(bid)-
D = 13+ hcp
P = {prio:-100} {stop} any hand

